20. Is an LLM Automatically Secure?

No.

An LLM being powerful does not automatically make an AI application secure.

Important security areas include:

Authentication
Authorization
API key protection
Input validation
Output validation
Rate limiting
Data privacy
Prompt injection protection
Secure database access
Logging
Monitoring
Never expose secret API keys in frontend code.

Bad:

Angular
   ↓
Secret API Key
   ↓
LLM Provider

Better:

Angular
   ↓
Backend
   ↓
Secret API Key
   ↓
LLM Provider
